tickets/

# Benchmark CSV outputs — regenerated on every run.
loadtest/results/

# Git Bash on Windows translates paths like `/tmp/...` and `/w` inside the project,
# creating invalid directories like `frontend/C:/...` or `backend;W`.
#
#
# Therefore: create build/temp files inside the container, not on the host.
*;W
*;C
**/C:/
_patch.py
_proof.py
